ackground-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\">Error in as.data.frame.default(x[[i]],\r\noptional = TRUE, stringsAsFactors = stringsAsFactors) : <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;word-break:break-all;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;\"> \r\ncannot coerce class &quot;c(&quot;riself&quot;, &quot;cross&quot;)&quot;\r\nto a data.frame<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\">Is\r\nthere any way to solve this?</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">I really appreciate any help you can provide.</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Cheers.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-size:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;b